{"strongs": "H2789", "word": "חֶ֫רֶשׂ", "translit": "che.re.s", "root": "חרש", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "earthenware, earthen vessel, sherd, potsherd", "definition": "חֶ֫רֶשׂ noun [masculine] earthenware, earthen vessel, sherd, potsherd , P and late (Late Hebrew חֶרֶס , Aramaic חֲרַס ) — absolute ׳ ח Lev 6:21 + 9 t., חָ֑רֶשׂ Num 5:17 + 4 t.; plural construct חַרְשֵׂי Isa 45:9 suffix חֲרָשֶׂיהָ Ezek 23:34 . — 1. earthenware: ׳ כְּלִיאח earthen vessel Jer 32:14 especially P Lev 6:21 ; Lev 11:33 ; Lev 14:5 ; Lev 14:50 ; Lev 15:12 ; without כְּלִי Prov 26:23 compare ׳ בַּקְבֻּק יוֺצֵר ח Jer 19:1 ׳ לְנִבְלֵי ח Lam 4:2 they are reckoned as earthen vessels , simile of sons of Zion; חֶרֶשׂ אֶתחַֿרְשֵׂי אֲדָמָה Isa 45:9 a potsherd (perhaps = earthen vessel , see Prov 26:23 above) among earthen potsherds (of men, over against ׳ י their potter); simile of dryness Ps 22:16 . 2. a fragment of earthenware, sherd Isa 30:14 ; Ezek 23:34 לְהִתְגָּרֵד ׳ ח Job 2:8 a sherd to scrape himself ; ׳ חַדּוּדֵי ח Job 41:22 sharpest potsherds , figurative of sharp scales on belly of crocodile. חֲרֶשֶׂת see קִירחֲֿרֶשֶׂת .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3178')\">BDB3178</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2789')\">H2789</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3177')\">BDB3177</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3179')\">BDB3179</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חֶ֫רֶשׂ</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>earthenware, earthen vessel, sherd, potsherd</highlightword>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> and late (Late Hebrew <bdbheb>חֶרֶס</bdbheb>, Aramaic <bdbarc>חֲרַס</bdbarc>) — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,21)\">Lev 6:21</ref> + 9 t., <bdbheb>חָ֑רֶשׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 5:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,17)\">Num 5:17</ref> + 4 t.; plural construct <bdbheb>חַרְשֵׂי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 45:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,9)\">Isa 45:9</ref> suffix <bdbheb>חֲרָשֶׂיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:34\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,34)\">Ezek 23:34</ref>. — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>earthenware:</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּלִיאח</bdbheb> <highlight>earthen vessel</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 32:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,14)\">Jer 32:14</ref> especially <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,21)\">Lev 6:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 11:33\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(3,11,33)\">Lev 11:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,5)\">Lev 14:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:50\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,50)\">Lev 14:50</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 15:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,15,12)\">Lev 15:12</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><wrongReferenceRemoved/> without <bdbheb>כְּלִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 26:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,23)\">Prov 26:23</ref> compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּקְבֻּק יוֺצֵר ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 19:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,19,1)\">Jer 19:1</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְנִבְלֵי ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 4:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,2)\">Lam 4:2</ref> they are reckoned <highlight>as earthen vessels</highlight>, simile of sons of Zion; <bdbheb>חֶרֶשׂ אֶתחַֿרְשֵׂי אֲדָמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 45:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,9)\">Isa 45:9</ref> <highlight>a potsherd</highlight> (perhaps = <highlight>earthen vessel</highlight>, see <ref ref=\"Prov 26:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,23)\">Prov 26:23</ref> above) <highlight>among earthen potsherds</highlight> (of men, over against <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> their potter); simile of dryness <ref ref=\"Ps 22:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,16)\">Ps 22:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>a fragment of earthenware, sherd</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,14)\">Isa 30:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:34\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,34)\">Ezek 23:34</ref> <bdbheb>לְהִתְגָּרֵד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 2:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,2,8)\">Job 2:8</ref> <highlight>a sherd to scrape himself</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חַדּוּדֵי ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 41:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,22)\">Job 41:22</ref> <highlight>sharpest potsherds</highlight>, figurative of sharp scales on belly of crocodile. </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>חֲרֶשֶׂת</bdbheb> see <bdbheb>קִירחֲֿרֶשֶׂת</bdbheb>.</p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Lev 6:21", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 6, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Num 5:17", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 5, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Isa 45:9", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 45, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 23:34", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 23, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Jer 32:14", "book": "JER", "chapter": 32, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Lev 11:33", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 11, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Lev 14:5", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 14, "verse": 5}, 